@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Anomaly Alerts Thresholds" as SAFR002
  usecase "FAFR005: Schedule Client Mentoring Sessions" as FAFR005
  usecase "SFR003: Request Financial Predictions" as SFR003
  usecase "SFR004: Deliver Personalized Recommendations" as SFR004
  usecase "SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards" as SFR012
  
  client --> CFR001 : View financial data and insights\nClient requests the system to present their comprehensive financial health through a dashboard.
  
  SysAdmin --> SAFR002 : Adjust anomaly detection parameters for compliance with regulations like Basel III.\nSystem Administrator manages settings that ensure accuracy in risk management algorithms.

  FAFR005 <|-- (FAFR001) : Schedule mentoring sessions based on system-generated insights\nFinancial Advisor uses the system's predictive analytics to plan client interactions.
  
  SFR003 --> AIFR001 : Request financial predictions using historical data and market trends.\nSystem requests future projections from AI for user insight.

  SFR004 --> AIFR002 : Request personalized recommendations based on user profiles and goals.\nSystem asks the AI to generate tailored advice.
  
  SFR012 --> CFR009 : Consolidate financial information into a single view dashboard\nSystem creates an integrated client overview for easy monitoring.

}

actor "Client" as Client
actor "Financial Advisor (FA)" as FADvisor
actor "SysAdmin" as SysAdmin

Client -> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters via System Administrator.\nAdjusts system settings to ensure compliance with financial regulations.
FADvisor --> AIFR003 : View client intervention alerts\nMonitors for patterns needing professional attention from advisors.

rectangle "System Components" {
  usecase "AIFR008: Generate Predictive Intervention Recommendations" as AIFR008
  usecase "SFR019: Maintain Historical Record of Insights" as SFR019

  SysAdmin --> SAFR003 : Request financial predictions from AI.\nSystem Administrator can generate forecasts for regulatory or strategic planning.

}

AIFR002 <|-- (SAFR006) : Generate spending limit alerts based on user-defined thresholds\nAI system monitors and reports when a client exceeds their set limits.
FA --> AIFR007: View contextualized news insights related to portfolio.\nFinancial Advisor receives relevant market updates tied to specific investments.

SysAdmin -> SAFR004 : Deliver personalized recommendations via System Administrator.\nAdministrator can manually adjust or approve AI-generated suggestions for clients.

client -->> CFR011 : Provide feedback on system outputs\nClient shares opinions to improve future outputs.
@enduml